{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2021-05-27 16:30:00', 'title': "LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. ANNOUNCES 33 PERCENT INCREASE TO QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C., MAY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD\xa0OF DIRECTORS\xa0FOR LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF EIGHTY CENTS ($0.80) PER SHARE, PAYABLE AUGUST 4, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JULY 21, 2021."}